<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sip</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>sip &lt;drink container&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>sip bottle
</pre>
<p>Takes a single sip from a bottle, waterskin or other drink container: it 
works like <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>, but you swallow only a mouthful. The game tells 
you what you sipped, so it is the careful way to find out what is in an 
unknown bottle, and the way to make a strong drink last in a tavern.
</p><p>Beware: a sip is still a drink. If the drink is poisoned, even a sip 
poisons you, and strong drink still goes to your head. You can't sip when 
you are too drunk to find your mouth, or when you can't hold any more.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Taste</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Pour</a>
</pre>




</div>